# Dependencies — reinstalled inside the image from the lockfile
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Build output
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/dist
**/.output
**/.nitro
**/build
**/out

# Local env & secrets — injected at runtime, never baked into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example

# VCS & tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
.husky
.vscode
.agents
.claude

# Native / mobile — not part of any container
apps/expo/.expo
apps/expo/android
apps/expo/ios

# Tests, docs & artifacts
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/e2e-screenshots
docs
*.md
!README.md

# Misc
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
